  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Extend Feature 1797214 CMDA Post Processing Validator to add referential integrity tests.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Optional capability to check for any relationship to an object.  And verify that object exists in the repository.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "For Fedora-defined objects (cmodel, sdep, sdef), check that certain required relationships exist:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "a) cmodel (optionally point to an sdef)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "b) sdep (must point to a cmodel and an sdef)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Note: This extends on the functionality of ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-123#icft=FCREPO-123"
       },
       "type": "inlineCard"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
